WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.866
Hello up there!

2
00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:09.867
Who are you?

3
00:00:09.867 --> 00:00:13.307
I'm a green

4
00:00:13.307 --> 00:00:16.699
iguana. Iguanas are a

5
00:00:16.699 --> 00:00:22.553
type of lizard. Where do you

6
00:00:22.553 --> 00:00:25.670
live? We live in

7
00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:30.782
warm places like Central America. The rain

8
00:00:30.782 --> 00:00:35.821
forest is our home. I like

9
00:00:35.821 --> 00:00:39.116
your spines. Our spines

10
00:00:39.116 --> 00:00:43.109
protect us from enemies. We have

11
00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:46.550
strong tails too. We use

12
00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:51.733
them to fight enemies. Your tail

13
00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:55.025
is very long. Sometimes we

14
00:00:55.026 --> 00:00:59.553
break off our tails. This helps

15
00:00:59.553 --> 00:01:02.936
us escape danger. Later we

16
00:01:02.936 --> 00:01:09.015
